    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Social Media Cross-Posting\nWrite a post once in a simple form and publish it to X, LinkedIn, your Facebook Page and your Telegram channel in one click.\n\n### Setup\n1. **X:** create an app at developer.x.com, add an *X OAuth2* credential in n8n and select it on *Post to X*.\n2. **LinkedIn:** add a *LinkedIn OAuth2* credential, then open *Post to LinkedIn*, switch *Person* to *From list* and pick yourself — or paste your person ID into Config.\n3. **Facebook:** add a *Facebook Graph API* credential using a **Page** access token (with `pages_manage_posts`), and put your Page ID in **Config → facebookPageId**.\n4. **Telegram:** create a bot with @BotFather, add it as an admin of your channel, add a *Telegram* credential and set **Config → telegramChannel** (e.g. `@mychannel`).\n5. Don't use a platform? Delete its two nodes (\"... Selected?\" and \"Post to ...\") and remove it from the form's *Post to* options.\n6. Activate, then open the form's **Production URL** and bookmark it.\n\nFull guide: README.md in this workflow's folder.",
        "height": 564,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
